<title>UK: LME lead rallies, touches three month high.</title>
<headline>LME lead rallies, touches three month high.</headline>
<text>
<p>LEAD - Moves to its highest level since early April as funds buy after market breaks above $640. Peaks at $657 a tonne. Market now eyeing $670.</p>
<p>COPPER - Higher after LME stocks fall.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Stable above $1,600, stocks down.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Steady.</p>
</text>
